<h1 class="ui center aligned header">What Can I Use Agents For?</h1>

<div class="ui info message">
  <div class="header">AI Agents in Dance Learning & Choreography</div>
  <p>AI agents can revolutionize how we learn, practice, and create dance. Here are practical applications for your dance journey:</p>
</div>

<div class="ui stackable three column grid">
  
  <div class="column">
    <div class="ui raised segment">
      <h3 class="ui header">
        <i class="graduation cap icon"></i>
        <div class="content">Learning & Training</div>
      </h3>
      <div class="ui relaxed list">
        <div class="item">
          <i class="check circle outline icon"></i>
          <div class="content">
            <strong>Personalized Instruction:</strong> Agents can analyze your skill level and create customized learning paths through dance components and steps.
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="item">
          <i class="check circle outline icon"></i>
          <div class="content">
            <strong>Real-time Feedback:</strong> Motion capture agents can provide instant corrections on footwork, timing, and positioning.
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="item">
          <i class="check circle outline icon"></i>
          <div class="content">
            <strong>Progress Tracking:</strong> AI can monitor your improvement across different dance styles and components over time.
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="column">
    <div class="ui raised segment">
      <h3 class="ui header">
        <i class="magic icon"></i>
        <div class="content">Choreography & Creativity</div>
      </h3>
      <div class="ui relaxed list">
        <div class="item">
          <i class="lightbulb outline icon"></i>
          <div class="content">
            <strong>Step Sequence Generation:</strong> Agents can combine footwork patterns and components to create new choreography.
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="item">
          <i class="lightbulb outline icon"></i>
          <div class="content">
            <strong>Music Synchronization:</strong> AI can match dance steps to musical beats and phrases automatically.
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="item">
          <i class="lightbulb outline icon"></i>
          <div class="content">
            <strong>Style Adaptation:</strong> Convert choreography between different dance styles (Salsa to Bachata, etc.).
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="column">
    <div class="ui raised segment">
      <h3 class="ui header">
        <i class="users icon"></i>
        <div class="content">Practice & Performance</div>
      </h3>
      <div class="ui relaxed list">
        <div class="item">
          <i class="play circle outline icon"></i>
          <div class="content">
            <strong>Virtual Practice Partner:</strong> AI agents can simulate leader/follower roles for solo practice sessions.
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="item">
          <i class="play circle outline icon"></i>
          <div class="content">
            <strong>Performance Analysis:</strong> Video analysis agents can evaluate timing, synchronization, and technique.
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="item">
          <i class="play circle outline icon"></i>
          <div class="content">
            <strong>Competition Preparation:</strong> Agents can help optimize routines for specific competition criteria.
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

</div>

<div class="ui stackable two column grid" style="margin-top: 2rem;">
  
  <div class="column">
    <div class="ui raised segment">
      <h3 class="ui header">
        <i class="cog icon"></i>
        <div class="content">Technical Applications</div>
      </h3>
      <div class="ui relaxed divided list">
        <div class="item">
          <strong>Motion Capture & Analysis:</strong>
          <div class="description">Agents can process video to extract precise foot positions, timing, and body mechanics for detailed analysis.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="item">
          <strong>Automated Notation:</strong>
          <div class="description">Convert video performances into standardized dance notation systems automatically.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="item">
          <strong>Injury Prevention:</strong>
          <div class="description">AI can analyze movement patterns to identify potentially harmful techniques and suggest corrections.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="column">
    <div class="ui raised segment">
      <h3 class="ui header">
        <i class="world icon"></i>
        <div class="content">Community & Social</div>
      </h3>
      <div class="ui relaxed divided list">
        <div class="item">
          <strong>Partner Matching:</strong>
          <div class="description">Agents can match dancers based on skill level, preferred styles, and learning goals.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="item">
          <strong>Event Recommendations:</strong>
          <div class="description">AI can suggest workshops, socials, and competitions based on your interests and skill level.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="item">
          <strong>Global Learning:</strong>
          <div class="description">Connect with international instructors and styles through AI-powered translation and cultural adaptation.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

</div>

<div class="ui message">
  <div class="header">Getting Started with AI Agents</div>
  <div class="ui ordered list">
    <div class="item">Start with simple motion tracking apps that provide basic feedback on your footwork and timing</div>
    <div class="item">Explore AI-powered music apps that can help you understand rhythm and musicality</div>
    <div class="item">Use video analysis tools to record and review your practice sessions</div>
    <div class="item">Look for AI choreography generators to spark creative inspiration</div>
    <div class="item">Join online communities where AI tools are being developed for dancers</div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="ui center aligned basic segment">
  <%= link_to "Back to Home", root_path, class: "ui primary button" %>
  <%= link_to "View Components", components_path, class: "ui button" %>
  <%= link_to "View Steps", steps_path, class: "ui button" %>
</div>